    "description": "Wooden Smoking Pipe Rack Cabinet\n7 Pipe Capacity, With Drawer and Lower Storage\nWood, 14\" x 6\" x 16\", Vintage\nThis classic wooden smoking pipe rack is designed for both tabletop display and wall-mounted use. Featuring a traditional aesthetic, the cabinet provides specialized storage for a collection of seven pipes, along with additional compartments for smoking accessories and tobacco tins. This functional piece serves as a dedicated organizational solution for enthusiasts, fitting seamlessly into a den, study, or lounge environment.\nTiered design with seven notched neck supports and circular base rests for pipe stability\nIntegrated storage including one central pull-out drawer and two lower cabinet doors with metal hardware\nDual wall-mounting brackets installed on the back for secure hanging\nMeasures approximately 16 inches high, 14 inches wide, and 6 inches deep\nCondition:\nThe wooden finish shows visible wear consistent with age, including scuffing and scratches along the side panels and base edges. There is noticeable cracking or lifting of the veneer/finish on the interior back panel of the rack area. The cabinet retains its original hardware, though surfaces show dust accumulation and light staining in the pipe rests. Structural integrity is sound with no missing components.",
